# The frontend's two mode files hold only values that are inlined into the public bundle
# anyway — the API origin and a Stripe *publishable* sandbox key — and the CI image build
# needs .env.production, so these two are committed. Never put a secret in them.
!apps/frontend/.env.development
!apps/frontend/.env.production
